*label post_mission_request
*page_break
*comment ---------- POST MISSION REQUEST ----------
You approach the mission board with the intent to post your own request. Perhaps you need assistance with a personal task or a quest that requires more hands than you can manage alone.
*line_break
*if (mission_board_request)
  You already have a request posted. You can update it or leave it as is.
  *line_break
*else
  You take a moment to gather your thoughts and write down the details of your request. What kind of help do you need? What are the specifics of the task? You want to make sure that those who read it understand what is required.
  *line_break
  *input_text mission_board_request_text
  *line_break
  You post your request on the board, hoping that someone will take notice and offer their assistance.
  *set mission_board_request true   
    *set mission_board_request_text mission_board_request_text
*line_break
*comment ---------- REQUEST OPTIONS ----------
*choice
  #View your posted request
    You take a moment to read over your posted request, ensuring that it is clear and concise.
    *line_break
    *if (mission_board_request_text)
      Your request: ${mission_board_request_text}
    *else
      No request posted yet.
    *line_break
  #Update your request
    You decide to make changes to your request. Perhaps you want to clarify some details or add more information.
    *input_text mission_board_request_text
    *set mission_board_request_text mission_board_request_text
    *line_break
    Your request has been updated.
  #Return to the mission board
    You step away from the board, feeling satisfied that your request is now posted and ready for potential helpers.
    *finish
  #Leave the mission board
    You decide to leave the mission board for now, perhaps to gather more information or prepare for your own adventures.
    *finish
  #Check back later
    You decide to wait and see if anyone responds to your request. The board may fill up with offers of assistance as others read your post.
    *finish 
  #Return to previous scene
    You feel that you need more time to prepare or gather information before posting a request. Perhaps returning later will help you decide your next steps.
    *goto_scene mission_board
